<!-- PBX3 grandstream.Common — GRP2602P mule (1.0.7.3). Global NAT/STUN + provision + NTP.
     Chatbot hygiene: no :// in P76/P48; root is gs_provision (see Extension).
     P-tag order is cosmetic — phone keys by P-code; P2 listed first for readability. -->
    <P2>$padminpass</P2>
    <P76>stun.l.google.com</P76>
    <P1119>30</P1119>
    <P212>2</P212>
    <P192>$provpath</P192>
    <P237>0</P237>
    <P31>pool.ntp.org</P31>
    <P64>GMT</P64>
